<title>UK: LONDON COAL/ORE FIXTURES.</title>
<headline>LONDON COAL/ORE FIXTURES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Cherokee - 150,000/10 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Sines 15/30 Sept $6.75 fio scale/30,000 shinc Bocimar.</p>
<p>Oceanic Mindoro - 110,000/10 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Taranto 19/29 Sept $6.15 fio 30,000 shinc/30,000 shinc Ilva.</p>
<p>Bona TBN - 70,000/10 Santa Marta/Redcar 3/9 Sept approx. $8.00 fio 10,000 shinc/20,000 shinc Klaveness.</p>
<p>ORE - Yukong TBN - 140/200,000 tonnes ore Sepetiba/Kwangyang and Pohang 20 Sept/4 Oct $10.30 fio 8 shinc Posco.</p>
<p>Alpha Gemini - 58,000 - tonnes ore Pointe Noire/Philadelphia 20/30 Aug $2.90 fio 5 days shinc Navios.</p>
</text>
